      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. the main thing i'm worried about is the \"hidden\" stuff. like, are there certain things that might trigger an inspection or a delay even if they have the right paperwork? i dont want them being pulled aside for some random reason at 3am in a transit lounge. what are the red flags for immigration officers usually looking for in these specific regions?",
